Rāvaṇa claps hands and assumes vast form --- Rāvaṇa boasts he could lift earth and drink ocean --- Rāvaṇa resumes ten-faced bow-bearing dread shape --- Rāvaṇa seizes Sītā by hair and thighs --- Golden mule chariot appears for Rāvaṇa --- Rāvaṇa lifts struggling Sītā skyward with threats --- Sītā cries to Rāma Lakṣmaṇa and dharma --- Sītā adjures trees mountains Gōdāvarī and beasts to inform Rāma